## 8. Documentation Lifecycle

Before every commit or PR, identify which docs are affected:

| Changed | Update this |
|---|---|
| Data model / DB schema | `.hive/specs/data-model.md` |
| API endpoints | `.hive/specs/api-spec.yml` (or equivalent) |
| New library or dependency | Relevant `.hive/standards/<area>.md` |
| Config / env vars / setup | `README.md` and/or `development_guide.md` |
| Architecture decision | New ADR in `docs/adr/` |
| Test patterns | Standards doc for the affected area |

Update in the same commit or PR — not later.

